From 0dad5b05f08a6d9e9b2c90de71b1ef644c103bb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:53:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] nested: GLORYS gateway transports from a standalone script on
 the CPU (glorys_gateways_run.jl); setup.jl

glorys_gateways advances GLORYS's clock and calls update_state! before sampling each day, so the days it reads are in
memory (without it the GPU kernel read past them: CUDA_ERROR_ILLEGAL_ADDRESS). It now takes a grid, not a model.
setup.jl holds the settings, packages, paths, grid and dates, included by panarctic_nested.jl and by
glorys_gateways_run.jl, which builds only the grid and runs on the CPU.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvpGsnzaJJu3V9mqrum
